  "reasoning": "The facts describe that the defendant, while holding village leadership positions, used his authority to appropriate money from land sales and agricultural subsidies (which fits the definition of 职务侵占 – illegal occupation of property using position). Additionally, he abused his role in managing various public funds (grain subsidies, low‑income subsidies, housing reconstruction, land‑transfer support) to embezzle large sums, which is the classic element of 贪污 – embezzlement by a public official of state‑owned funds. No other distinct crimes are indicated, so the appropriate charges are the two listed offenses.",
